## Context

Exp2 began as an "extension of Exp2 to arms 3 and 4", then was reframed **from the
start** as a 2×2 design — the second abandoned branch (companion to 0361's modular
ablation). The **slides already carry the live 2×2**, framed as observable
commercial-AI-product features: (single-turn vs multi-turn) × (no-docs vs RAG),
conditions 1N/5N/1D/5D (slides.tex:279-292), with `tab_exp2_2x2` at slides.tex:349
generated by `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py`, and the finding "Effet du RAG > effet du
multitour" (slides.tex:344).

The **report never finished the migration**: it still
`\InputIfFileExists{tab_exp2_arms}` (report.tex:200) and carries four "arms"
generators. This is a **reconciliation, not a deletion** — Exp2 is a live
experiment; only its old "arms" framing is stale.

## Scope (REVISED 2026-05-27 — original deletion list was unsafe; see log)

**Report (adopt the 2×2 features framing) — the substance of this ticket:**
- Replace `tab_exp2_arms` (report.tex:193, post-0361) with `tab_exp2_2x2` —
  ALREADY committed at `report/inputs/generated/tab_exp2_2x2.tex` (produced by
  `analysis.mk` ANALYSIS_EXP2_2X2_TEX, the 0345 handoff pattern; no new producer).
- Align the Exp2 prose with the 1N/5N/1D/5D conditions and the "RAG > multitour"
  finding (the committed 2×2 shows Documents +0.108 vs Query-mode −0.078); rewrite
  the "bras naive et optimise" caption (report.tex ~199).
  **Do NOT touch report.tex:404 "bras corrigé"** — decomposition-fix sub-experiment,
  not the Exp2 2×2 (preflight).
- `fig_quality_spider` (`fig:exp2-quality-spider`, report.tex:195-202): **RETIRE
  from the report** (MHD 2026-05-27) — remove the `\IfFileExists` block + the
  report.pdf prereq. Naive/optimise data contradicts the 2×2 framing; superseded by
  the dedicated exp2 4-way spider (0311). Leave its producer (`plot_quality_spider`
  in analysis.mk) untouched.

**Retire ONLY the one genuinely-dead arms artifact** (the DAG guard caught that
`plot_exp2_arms_comparison` is NOT an orphan — see log):
- `src/aedist/tabulate_exp2_arms.py` (→ retired `tab_exp2_arms.tex`, used by no
  surviving consumer) + `tests/test_tabulate_exp2_arms.py`
  + `report/inputs/generated/tab_exp2_arms.tex`.
- Rules: `analysis.mk` ANALYSIS_EXP2_TABLE (var + rule + ANALYSIS_EXP2_REPORT_TARGETS
  line); root `Makefile` `tab_exp2_arms.tex` tokens (report.pdf prereq, `tables:`).

**KEEP — load-bearing for the slides, the live 2×2, and the manuscript (do NOT delete):**
- `plot_exp2_arms_comparison.py` → `fig_exp2_arms_comparison.pdf` — consumed by the
  **live manuscript** `slides/manuscript/main.md` (Figure 3) and `slides/Makefile`.
  NOT an orphan (the first revision wrongly called it one).
- `plot_exp2_arms_split.py` → `fig_exp2_coverage.pdf`/`fig_exp2_cost.pdf` (slides
  prereqs, Makefile:220-221).
- `tabulate_exp2_arms_runs.py` → `tab_exp2_arms_runs.csv` → mart view
  `tab_exp2_arms_runs_view.csv`, consumed by the 2×2, `plot_exp2_coverage_certainty`
  (slides fig), `tabulate_stat_tests`.
- `build_exp2_mart*.py`, `check_exp2_mart_parity.py`, `plot_exp2_coverage_certainty.py`,
  `tabulate_stat_tests.py`, the `arm1..arm4_flat` stages, `tabulate_exp2_2x2.py`.
- The mart-internal "arms" terminology is the 2×2's data foundation (arm1-4 = the
  four cells). Any rename is OUT of scope → **0364**.

## Test (first)
`tests/test_exp2_arms_retired.py` (`@pytest.mark.adherence`):
- the report **table** `tab_exp2_arms` appears in NO `report/*.tex` — do NOT forbid
  `exp2_arms` broadly (structural in the mart pipeline);
- report Exp2 presents the 2×2 (`report.tex` includes `tab_exp2_2x2`);
- `tabulate_exp2_arms.py` is gone from `src/aedist/`, while
  `plot_exp2_arms_comparison.py` + `plot_exp2_arms_split.py` +
  `tabulate_exp2_arms_runs.py` REMAIN (regression guard against the over-deletion
  the DAG guard caught — the first two feed the manuscript / slides / 2×2).

## Exit criteria
- [x] report Exp2 includes `tab_exp2_2x2`; `tab_exp2_arms` no longer included
- [x] `fig_quality_spider` retired from the report (block + prereq removed)
- [x] only `tabulate_exp2_arms` (+test+artifact) removed; `plot_exp2_arms_comparison`
      + `plot_exp2_arms_split` + `tabulate_exp2_arms_runs` + mart modules intact
- [ ] `make report` and `make slides` build; `make check` passes (UNVERIFIED — no
      LaTeX engine in this env; make slides has the pre-existing fig_capability_dag
      break); test_exp2_arms_retired + DAG/dedup/figsize guards green
